          "name": "DiskSize",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": true,
          "type": "int",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "数据盘ID。LOCAL_BASIC 和 LOCAL_SSD 类型没有ID，暂时不支持该参数。\n该参数目前仅用于DescribeInstances等查询类接口的返回参数，不可用于RunInstances等写接口的入参。\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "\"disk-lzrg2pwi\"",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "DiskId",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": true,
          "type": "string",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "硬盘介质类型。取值范围：\n\n- CLOUD_BASIC：表示普通云硬盘\n- CLOUD_PREMIUM：表示高性能云硬盘\n- CLOUD_BSSD：表示通用型SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_SSD：表示SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_HSSD：表示增强型SSD云硬盘\n- CLOUD_TSSD：表示极速型SSD云硬盘。\n注意：此字段可能返回 null，表示取不到有效值。",
          "example": "CLOUD_HSSD",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "DiskType",
          "output_required": false,
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "value_allowed_null": true
        }
      ],
      "usage": "both"
